   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": "Not everyone is that relaxed about it. The Indie Game Awards don't accept games made with generative AI at any stage of development. Last December they took back Clair Obscur: Expedition 33's Game of the Year and Debut Game awards, after AI-generated assets were found in the version that shipped (",
       "decorations": []
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": "Insider Gaming",
       "decorations": [
        {
         "type": "BOLD",
         "fontWeightValue": 700
        },
        {
         "type": "COLOR",
         "colorData": {
          "foreground": "#d7182a"
         }
        },
        {
         "type": "LINK",
         "linkData": {
          "link": {
           "url": "https://insider-gaming.com/indie-game-awards-disqualifies-clair-obscur-expedition-33-gen-ai/",
           "target": "BLANK"
          }
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": "). Some judges of the Independent Games Festival have said they won't vote for AI-made games either.",
       "decorations": []
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": "Asked about that, Nero picked “too blunt: judge the game”, and explained it with something every digital artist knows:",
       "decorations": []
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "BLOCKQUOTE",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [
       {
        "type": "TEXT",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": [],
        "textData": {
         "text": "AI as a tool is just a tool. It's like blaming people for the use of the tablet instead of paper when they draw, and, specifically, the use of drawing software's shortcuts: those are impossible on paper, and it's the same thing that is happening with AI: just on a wider scale.",
         "decorations": [
          {
           "type": "ITALIC",
           "italicData": true
          },
          {
           "type": "COLOR",
           "colorData": {
            "foreground": "#13224b"
           }
          },
          {
           "type": "FONT_SIZE",
           "fontSizeData": {
            "unit": "PX",
            "value": 20
           }
          }
         ]
        }
       }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
     },
     {
