        "type": "TEXT",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": [],
        "textData": {
         "text": "AI is a great opportunity: it's up to us to understand where it's worth for us to explore more, to overcome our limits, to try something new with our own hands. AI can also be a great tool to learn and do exactly this. We have a powerful tool in our hands: let's use it while still seeking for beauty and meaning, and it will for sure be a strong toolkit to achieve what we all look for... and maybe even beyond.",
